  "description": "Subject: Incident Summary for Station\u202fSTN\u2011001 (May\u2011June\u202f2026)\n\nDuring the past month the station identified as STN\u2011001 experienced several equipment events that required attention. Pump\u202fPMP\u201112 failed on 20\u202fMay\u202f2026 at\u202f14:35\u202fUTC, and a second pump, PMP\u201115, went out of service on 22\u202fMay\u202f2026 at\u202f08:00\u202fUTC. Later, on 1\u202fJune\u202f2026 at\u202f11:20\u202fUTC, a leak was detected in tank\u202fTNK\u20117 with a measured rate of\u202f3.5. The leak was subsequently addressed, and on 3\u202fJune\u202f2026 at\u202f13:00\u202fUTC tank\u202fTNK\u20119 was refilled."
